{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9kzahwjy","slideIndex":16,"position":{"left":22,"top":188,"width":438,"height":255.85},"name":"English dialogue","text":"Oh no! Piku accidentally knocked over a plant while flying around the garden. Piku felt very sorry for her mistake, but her friends came forward to help her and encourage her.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#16211D","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8j698rid","slideIndex":16,"position":{"left":22,"top":461.85,"width":438,"height":226.15},"name":"Hindi dialogue","text":"अरे नहीं! बगीचे में उड़ते हुए पिकू से गलती से एक पौधा गिर गया। पिकू को अपनी गलती पर बहुत अफ़सोस हुआ, लेकिन उसके दोस्त उसकी मदद करने और उसका हौसला बढ़ाने के लिए आगे आए।","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22.67,"typeface":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#E23A72","alignment":"left"}}
